<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz adds 50 mln DEM to hybrid bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz adds 50 mln DEM to hybrid bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible structured issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT     50 MLN DEM   COUPON   **9.00	MATURITY    27.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.875    PAY DATE   *21.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY   GERMANY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    **PAYS 16 PCT MINUS (TWO TIMES SIX-MONTH LIBOR) AFTER</p>
<p>		THREE YEARS. *PLUS 24 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
